Feature: Restarting a mission
  WP1 sends the mission back to its first item. A plane also starts its mission again when
  you disarm it. In AUTO, it keeps its place, so that a mission can continue after a landing.
  In ArduPilot, MIS_RESTART and an RC switch with option 24 also restart the mission.

  Expectation: WP1 restarts the mission
    Given the vehicle mission is not empty
    When the operator restarts the mission
    Then the vehicle's current item is 1

  Expectation: Disarming outside AUTO restarts the mission
    Given the vehicle is armed
    And the vehicle mission is not empty
    And the autopilot mode is not AUTO
    When the operator disarms the vehicle
    Then the vehicle's current item is 1

  Expectation: Disarming in AUTO keeps the plane's place
    Given the vehicle is armed
    And the autopilot mode is AUTO
    When the operator disarms the vehicle
    Then the vehicle's current item stays the same
